1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:01,540
Pedangnya tidak menyentuh siapa pun.

2
00:00:01,880 --> 00:00:03,227
Tapi lampu poin tetap menyala.

3
00:00:03,677 --> 00:00:06,216
Montreal, 19 Juli 1976.

4
00:00:06,556 --> 00:00:09,668
Boris Onishchenko, peraih emas Olimpiade dari Uni Soviet,

5
00:00:10,008 --> 00:00:12,345
bertanding anggar di cabang pancalomba modern.

6
00:00:12,500 --> 00:00:15,023
Di anggar ini, ujung pedang harus ditekan ke tubuh

7
00:00:15,023 --> 00:00:15,688
lawan.

8
00:00:15,688 --> 00:00:17,391
Tekanan itu menutup sirkuit listrik,

9
00:00:17,669 --> 00:00:18,598
lalu lampu menyala.

10
00:00:19,048 --> 00:00:21,602
Lawan Inggris pertamanya, Adrian Parker,

11
00:00:21,942 --> 00:00:22,933
langsung protes.

12
00:00:23,273 --> 00:00:24,511
Ia merasa tidak tersentuh.

13
00:00:24,851 --> 00:00:27,234
Wasit memeriksa sekilas, dan poin tetap sah.

14
00:00:27,574 --> 00:00:28,797
Berikutnya Jim Fox.

15
00:00:29,137 --> 00:00:30,546
Waktu tersisa 40 detik.

16
00:00:30,794 --> 00:00:34,090
Saat lampu menyala, ujung pedang Boris justru mengarah ke

17
00:00:34,121 --> 00:00:34,821
atas.

18
00:00:35,003 --> 00:00:37,650
Boris minta maaf, dan menawarkan ganti pedang.

19
00:00:37,990 --> 00:00:39,847
Tim Soviet bahkan menyerahkan pedang lain.

20
00:00:40,187 --> 00:00:42,137
Tapi wasit menyita yang asli.

21
00:00:42,587 --> 00:00:43,872
Lalu pedang itu dibongkar.

22
00:00:44,212 --> 00:00:45,807
Di gagangnya ada lubang bor,

23
00:00:45,838 --> 00:00:47,308
ditutup kain kulit yang rapat.

24
00:00:47,648 --> 00:00:49,413
Di dalamnya, sebuah tombol logam.

25
00:00:49,753 --> 00:00:52,400
Cukup tekan dengan jari manis dan kelingking,

26
00:00:52,740 --> 00:00:54,690
sirkuit tertutup, dan lampu menyala.

27
00:00:54,907 --> 00:00:55,607
Tanpa sentuhan.

28
00:00:55,992 --> 00:00:58,700
Boris membantah, dan bilang itu bukan pedangnya.

29
00:00:59,040 --> 00:01:01,919
Tapi ia kidal, sedangkan semua rekan setimnya tidak.

30
00:01:02,259 --> 00:01:04,179
Putusan juri: kasus penipuan.

31
00:01:04,519 --> 00:01:07,134
Hasilnya dihapus, tim Soviet gugur,

32
00:01:07,351 --> 00:01:09,394
dan Boris dilarang bertanding seumur hidup.

33
00:01:09,734 --> 00:01:11,468
Emas beregu jatuh ke Inggris,

34
00:01:11,808 --> 00:01:13,139
tim yang pertama kali protes.

35
00:01:13,589 --> 00:01:16,267
Kalau kamu jadi Parker, berani protes?

36
00:01:16,267 --> 00:01:17,490
Tulis di komentar.

37
00:01:17,830 --> 00:01:19,935
Ikuti AUDIRA Sport Facts.

